      "name": "Memory Lapse",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "mental"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The touch of a forgotten dead pulls away gossamer strands of their victim's memories. The target must attempt a DC 19 Will Saving Throw save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is Stupefied 1 for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is Stupefied 2 for 1 round, then stupefied 1 for 1 minute. Once the creature has become stupefied 1, the target can attempt another saving throw at the end of each of its turns to end the stupefied condition, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 on each such save</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target cannot attempt saving throws to end the condition.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
